{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17148","headline":"赋得白云起封中 · 张嗣初","name":"赋得白云起封中","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"英英白云起，呈瑞出封中。\n表圣宁因地，逢时岂待风。\n浮光弥皎洁，流影更冲融。\n自叶尧年美，谁云汉日同。\n金泥光乍掩，玉检气潜通。\n欲与非烟并，亭亭不散空。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张嗣初","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17148.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17148","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}